<title>JAPAN: NKK Corp files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>NKK Corp files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>NKK Corp said on Monday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry for a shelf registration to issue up to 300 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
<p>The steelmaker said the registration would be effective for two years, starting on January 21.</p>
